          "defense_target_type": "def",
          "description": "<ul><li><p><a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.P7eaFojxra2gTRTG\" data-id=\"P7eaFojxra2gTRTG\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\"><strong>Trigger</strong></a>&nbsp;the start of the <strong>Roo</strong>'s turn</p></li></ul><p>The Roo chooses one creature and begins walking toward it. It does not hurry and it does not stop. On the third step it arrives within reach, and draws the knife.</p>",
