          "active_description": "<p>The Roo raises a kitchen knife in both hands and buries it in you. Deal <strong>devastating</strong>&nbsp;<a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.vKU8UYT6DBhgOjtE\" data-id=\"vKU8UYT6DBhgOjtE\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Item\"><strong>Dark</strong></a>&nbsp;damage to one creature, ignoring its Resistances and Immunities. The Roo then walks away and is gone from the conflict.</p>",
