      "study_text": "<p>A small dead thing in a green robe, carrying a lantern and a kitchen knife. It does not defend itself and it does not need to — steel and venom pass through it like weather, and it is <strong>quicker than it looks</strong> to sidestep a blow.</p><p>It is not hunting the party. It is hunting <strong>one of them</strong>, and it has already decided which. Everything else it does is filling the time until it arrives. <strong>Whatever it is that finally burns away a grudge, it is not darkness.</strong></p>",
